ere.\n-\t\toct.x = 1.0;\n-\t}\n-","path":"servers/rendering/renderer_rd/shaders/skeleton.glsl","commit_id":"5ae06178f2da85f5a4d28d3420737ffb872e6a23","original_commit_id":"a5ca958b4d2fcd9e4e28922a74e9cebba4dbb508","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"The problem is not the total amount of precision. The problem is that you introduce artifacts for any direction which encodes to a value of `oct.y == 1.0`. The mean error of octahedral encoding is not relevant. ","created_at":"2026-07-06T20:45:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T20:45:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120901#discussion_r3531945368","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120901","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3531945368"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120901#discussion_r3531945368"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120901"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3531945368/reactions","tot